# name source what-it-is-for: third-party skills installed from their source. source is a git URL, or <url>@<commit>#<folder> for one skill folder of a repo pinned to a commit
clarity https://github.com/addyosmani/clarity.git Draft, rewrite or review prose other people will read, so it is specific and sounds like its author without inventing facts.
impeccable https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable.git@508d7e8955de3b3caf2d8676e85206723d41a887#.claude/skills/impeccable Design, critique, audit and polish frontend interfaces with a consistent visual direction, and keep an existing brand.
